# Klingon ships sail to the Federation Constructors on kling1 and fight them; the damage nodes of the models that lose
# crew or systems show, and the dumps name them (kconst13 shows `target` from 186 s, four nodes from 190 s).
# Run it with --map kling1; the README, "Run a play script", has the command. The run takes about 190 s of game time.
scroll down 20
hold Left 1.4
hold Up 0.9
wait 0.2
box Toral Negvar1 Negvar2 Assault1 Assault2 Vorcha1 Vorcha2 Bop1 Bop2 Bop3 Bop4 Bop5
hold Right 1.4
hold Down 0.9
wait 0.2
attack kconst13
wait 150
dump f1
shot f1
wait 4
dump f2
shot f2
wait 4
dump f3
shot f3
wait 4
dump f4
shot f4
wait 4
dump f5
shot f5
wait 4
dump f6
shot f6
wait 4
dump f7
shot f7
wait 4
dump f8
shot f8
wait 4
dump f9
shot f9
wait 4
dump f10
shot f10
wait 4
dump f11
shot f11
wait 4
dump f12
shot f12
wait 4
